---
// Sensei Companion / Pendamping Belajar (Fixed & Draggable / Geser-able Mascot)
// Menampilkan Avatar #7 sebagai Sensei yang memberikan kata-kata penyemangat setiap kali diklik.
// Mendukung drag & drop sentuh (touch/pointer) pada mobile dan desktop agar tidak mengganggu bacaan.

interface SenseiQuote {
  japanese: string;
  romaji: string;
  meaning: string;
  tag: string;
}

const senseiQuotes: SenseiQuote[] = [
  {
    japanese: '「頑張ってください！」',
    romaji: 'Ganbatte kudasai!',
    meaning: 'Semangat ya! Lakukan yang terbaik dan jangan mudah menyerah hari ini!',
    tag: '🔥 Semangat',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「七転び八起き」',
    romaji: 'Nana korobi ya oki',
    meaning: 'Tujuh kali jatuh, delapan kali bangkit! Kegagalan adalah awal keberhasilan.',
    tag: '⛩️ Peribahasa',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「継続は力なり」',
    romaji: 'Keizoku wa chikara nari',
    meaning: 'Konsistensi adalah kekuatan! Belajar sedikit setiap hari jauh lebih baik daripada terburu-buru.',
    tag: '💪 Konsistensi',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「塵も積もれば山となる」',
    romaji: 'Chiri mo tsumoreba yama to naru',
    meaning: 'Debu pun jika ditumpuk akan menjadi gunung! Hafalan 5 kosakata hari ini akan jadi ratusan kosakata nanti.',
    tag: '⛰️ Langkah Kecil',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「千里の道も一歩から」',
    romaji: 'Senri no michi mo ippo kara',
    meaning: 'Perjalanan seribu mil dimulai dari satu langkah awal. Kamu sudah melangkah hebat hari ini!',
    tag: '🚶 Langkah Awal',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「為せば成る」',
    romaji: 'Naseba naru',
    meaning: 'Jika bersungguh-sungguh, pasti bisa tercapai! Percayalah pada kemampuan dan proses belajarmu.',
    tag: '✨ Percaya Diri',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「今日もお疲れ様でした！」',
    romaji: 'Kyou mo otsukaresama deshita!',
    meaning: 'Terima kasih atas kerja kerasmu belajar bahasa Jepang hari ini! Jangan lupa istirahat yang cukup ya.',
    tag: '🍵 Apresiasi',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「失敗は成功の基」',
    romaji: 'Shippai wa seikou no moto',
    meaning: 'Kesalahan adalah dasar kesuksesan. Jangan takut salah saat latihan kanji atau tata bahasa!',
    tag: '🌱 Pembelajaran',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「一期一会」',
    romaji: 'Ichi-go ichi-e',
    meaning: 'Hargai setiap momen belajar berharga. Materi yang kamu baca hari ini akan membuka wawasan baru!',
    tag: '🌸 Filosofi',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「焦らず、休まず」',
    romaji: 'Aserazu, yasumazu',
    meaning: 'Tanpa terburu-buru, tanpa berhenti. Nikmati alur belajarmu perlahan tapi pasti.',
    tag: '⏳ Ritme Belajar',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「大丈夫、きっとできる！」',
    romaji: 'Daijoubu, kitto dekiru!',
    meaning: 'Tenang saja, kamu pasti bisa menaklukkan JLPT impianmu! Sensei selalu mendukungmu!',
    tag: '🎯 Target JLPT',
  },
  {
    japanese: '「雨降って地固まる」',
    romaji: 'Ame futte ji katamaru',
    meaning: 'Setelah hujan, tanah menjadi semakin padat. Rintangan belajar saat ini membuat pemahamanmu makin kokoh!',
    tag: '🌈 Ketangguhan',
  },
];
---

<div
  id="sensei-companion-container"
  class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 z-40 select-none touch-none"
  style="touch-action: none;"
>
  
  <!-- Sensei Speech Bubble / Chat Penyemangat -->
  <div
    id="sensei-speech-bubble"
    class="hidden absolute bottom-[108%] right-0 w-[calc(100vw-32px)] max-w-[280px] sm:max-w-[320px] bg-[var(--color-surface)] dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-[var(--color-border-washi)] rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 transition-all duration-200 transform origin-bottom-right"
    role="dialog"
    aria-label="Pesan motivasi dari Sensei"
  >
    <!-- Speech Bubble Pointer Arrow (Connecting to Sensei) -->
    <div
      id="sensei-bubble-arrow"
      class="absolute -bottom-2 right-8 sm:right-10 w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-[var(--color-surface)] dark:bg-neutral-900 border-r border-b border-[var(--color-border-washi)] rotate-45 pointer-events-none"
    ></div>

    <!-- Bubble Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-2 mb-2 border-b border-[var(--color-border-washi)] relative z-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-vermilion)] animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--color-vermilion)] uppercase tracking-wider truncate">Sensei Nihongo</span>
        <span
          id="sensei-quote-tag"
          class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-[9.5px] font-bold text-[var(--color-vermilion)] border border-red-200/80 dark:border-red-900/50 shrink-0"
        >
          {senseiQuotes[0].tag}
        </span>
      </div>

      <button
        id="sensei-close-btn"
        type="button"
        class="text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] p-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-100 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer shrink-0"
        aria-label="Tutup pesan Sensei"
        title="Tutup pesan"
      >
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Bubble Body with Smooth Fade Transition -->
    <div id="sensei-quote-body" class="relative z-10 space-y-1 transition-opacity duration-150">
      <p
        id="sensei-quote-japanese"
        class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] font-japanese leading-snug tracking-tight"
      >
        {senseiQuotes[0].japanese}
      </p>
      <p
        id="sensei-quote-romaji"
        class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-vermilion)] font-sans italic"
      >
        {senseiQuotes[0].romaji}
      </p>
      <p
        id="sensei-quote-meaning"
        class="text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed pt-0.5"
      >
        {senseiQuotes[0].meaning}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bubble Footer -->
    <div class="mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--color-border-washi)] flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)] relative z-10">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span>✨</span>
        <span>Klik untuk pesan lain</span>
      </span>
      <span id="sensei-quote-counter" class="font-mono font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)]">1/{senseiQuotes.length}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sensei Character Button & Drag Target -->
  <button
    id="sensei-trigger-btn"
    type="button"
    class="group relative flex flex-col items-center cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing select-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--color-vermilion)] rounded-2xl transition-transform"
    title="Sensei Pendamping — Klik untuk penyemangat, atau seret/geser jika menghalangi bacaan!"
    aria-label="Sensei Pendamping - Klik untuk pesan motivasi atau geser posisi"
    style="touch-action: none;"
  >
    <!-- Floating 'Sensei' Stamp Seal Badge (Hanko) -->
    <div
      class="absolute -top-1.5 -left-1.5 z-20 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-vermilion)] text-white font-bold text-[9.5px] shadow-sm border border-white/50 dark:border-neutral-900 -rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-200 pointer-events-none"
      title="Sensei Pendamping"
    >
      先生
    </div>

    <!-- Idle Tooltip (Disappears when chat is open or dragging) -->
    <div
      id="sensei-idle-tooltip"
      class="absolute -top-7 right-0 bg-[var(--color-surface)] dark:bg-neutral-800 border border-[var(--color-border-washi)] shadow-xs rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[9.5px] font-bold text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)] group-hover:text-[var(--color-vermilion)] group-hover:border-red-300 transition-all pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap animate-bounce"
    >
      💬 Klik / Geser Sensei!
    </div>

    <!-- Sensei Character Image Container (Avatar #7) -->
    <div class="w-[72px] h-[88px] sm:w-[84px] sm:h-[100px] flex items-end justify-center group-hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out pointer-events-none">
      <img
        id="sensei-avatar-img"
        src="/avatar/sensei.webp"
        alt="Sensei Pendamping Nihongo_repo"
        width="84"
        height="100"
        decoding="async"
        class="w-full h-full object-contain object-bottom filter drop-shadow-md group-hover:drop-shadow-xl transition-all duration-200"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Soft Contact Floor Shadow -->
    <div class="w-12 sm:w-14 h-1.5 bg-neutral-900/15 dark:bg-black/45 rounded-full blur-[2px] mx-auto -mt-1 group-hover:scale-90 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Subtle Drag Handle Cue (3 Grip Dots) -->
    <div
      id="sensei-drag-grip"
      class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 mt-1 opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"
      title="Bisa digeser ke mana saja"
    >
      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)]"></span>
      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)]"></span>
      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)]"></span>
    </div>
  </button>

</div>

<script define:vars={{ senseiQuotes }}>
  (function () {
    const quotes = senseiQuotes;
    let lastIndex = -1;

    function initSensei() {
      const container = document.getElementById('sensei-companion-container');
      const triggerBtn = document.getElementById('sensei-trigger-btn');
      const speechBubble = document.getElementById('sensei-speech-bubble');
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById('sensei-close-btn');
      const avatarImg = document.getElementById('sensei-avatar-img');
      const idleTooltip = document.getElementById('sensei-idle-tooltip');
      const arrowEl = document.getElementById('sensei-bubble-arrow');

      const tagEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-tag');
      const jpEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-japanese');
      const romajiEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-romaji');
      const meaningEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-meaning');
      const counterEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-counter');
      const bodyEl = document.getElementById('sensei-quote-body');

      if (!container || !triggerBtn || !speechBubble || !closeBtn || !avatarImg) return;

      // --- Quote Cycling Logic ---
      function updateQuote(index) {
        const q = quotes[index];
        if (!q) return;

        if (bodyEl) bodyEl.style.opacity = '0.2';

        setTimeout(() => {
          if (tagEl) tagEl.textContent = q.tag;
          if (jpEl) jpEl.textContent = q.japanese;
          if (romajiEl) romajiEl.textContent = q.romaji;
          if (meaningEl) meaningEl.textContent = q.meaning;
          if (counterEl) counterEl.textContent = `${index + 1}/${quotes.length}`;

          if (bodyEl) bodyEl.style.opacity = '1';
        }, 80);
      }

      function updateBubbleOrientation() {
        const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
        const winWidth = window.innerWidth;
        const winHeight = window.innerHeight;

        // Reset classes
        speechBubble.classList.remove(
          'bottom-[108%]',
          'top-[108%]',
          'right-0',
          'left-0',
          'left-1/2',
          '-translate-x-1/2',
          'origin-bottom-right',
          'origin-bottom-left',
          'origin-top-right',
          'origin-top-left',
          'origin-bottom',
          'origin-top'
        );

        if (arrowEl) {
          arrowEl.className = 'absolute w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-[var(--color-surface)] dark:bg-neutral-900 rotate-45 pointer-events-none';
        }

        const isNearTop = rect.top < 240;
        const isNearLeft = rect.left < 160;
        const isNearRight = winWidth - rect.right < 160;

        // Vertical orientation
        if (isNearTop) {
          speechBubble.classList.add('top-[108%]');
          if (arrowEl) {
            arrowEl.classList.add('-top-2', 'border-l', 'border-t', 'border-[var(--color-border-washi)]');
          }
        } else {
          speechBubble.classList.add('bottom-[108%]');
          if (arrowEl) {
            arrowEl.classList.add('-bottom-2', 'border-r', 'border-b', 'border-[var(--color-border-washi)]');
          }
        }

        // Horizontal orientation
        if (isNearLeft) {
          speechBubble.classList.add('left-0', isNearTop ? 'origin-top-left' : 'origin-bottom-left');
          if (arrowEl) arrowEl.classList.add('left-6');
        } else if (isNearRight) {
          speechBubble.classList.add('right-0', isNearTop ? 'origin-top-right' : 'origin-bottom-right');
          if (arrowEl) arrowEl.classList.add('right-6');
        } else {
          speechBubble.classList.add('left-1/2', '-translate-x-1/2', isNearTop ? 'origin-top' : 'origin-bottom');
          if (arrowEl) arrowEl.classList.add('left-1/2', '-translate-x-1/2');
        }
      }

      function openBubble() {
        updateBubbleOrientation();
        speechBubble.classList.remove('hidden');
        if (idleTooltip) idleTooltip.classList.add('hidden');

        // Play lively character hop
        avatarImg.style.transform = 'scale(1.1) translateY(-6px)';
        setTimeout(() => {
          avatarImg.style.transform = '';
        }, 180);
      }

      function closeBubble() {
        speechBubble.classList.add('hidden');
        if (idleTooltip && !isDragging) idleTooltip.classList.remove('hidden');
      }

      function cycleNextQuote() {
        let nextIndex;
        if (quotes.length > 1) {
          do {
            nextIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * quotes.length);
          } while (nextIndex === lastIndex);
        } else {
          nextIndex = 0;
        }

        lastIndex = nextIndex;
        updateQuote(nextIndex);
        openBubble();
      }

      // --- Draggable Mascot Implementation (Pointer / Touch / Mouse) ---
      let isDragging = false;
      let hasDragged = false;
      let startPointerX = 0;
      let startPointerY = 0;
      let initialLeft = 0;
      let initialTop = 0;
      let justFinishedDrag = false;

      // Restore saved position from localStorage
      try {
        const savedPos = localStorage.getItem('nihongo_sensei_pos');
        if (savedPos) {
          const { leftRatio, topRatio } = JSON.parse(savedPos);
          if (typeof leftRatio === 'number' && typeof topRatio === 'number') {
            const clampX = Math.min(Math.max(8, leftRatio * window.innerWidth), window.innerWidth - 80);
            const clampY = Math.min(Math.max(64, topRatio * window.innerHeight), window.innerHeight - 100);
            container.style.left = `${clampX}px`;
            container.style.top = `${clampY}px`;
            container.style.bottom = 'auto';
            container.style.right = 'auto';
            updateBubbleOrientation();
          }
        }
      } catch (err) {}

      function onPointerDown(e) {
        // Only accept primary button (left click or single touch)
        if (e.button !== undefined && e.button !== 0) return;

        startPointerX = e.clientX;
        startPointerY = e.clientY;

        const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
        initialLeft = rect.left;
        initialTop = rect.top;

        hasDragged = false;
        isDragging = false;

        try {
          triggerBtn.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);
        } catch (_) {}

        triggerBtn.addEventListener('pointermove', onPointerMove);
        triggerBtn.addEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
        triggerBtn.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerUp);
      }

      function onPointerMove(e) {
        const deltaX = e.clientX - startPointerX;
        const deltaY = e.clientY - startPointerY;

        if (!hasDragged && Math.hypot(deltaX, deltaY) > 6) {
          hasDragged = true;
          isDragging = true;
          if (idleTooltip) idleTooltip.classList.add('hidden');
          container.style.transition = 'none';
          triggerBtn.style.cursor = 'grabbing';
          container.style.bottom = 'auto';
          container.style.right = 'auto';
        }

        if (isDragging) {
          e.preventDefault();

          const targetLeft = initialLeft + deltaX;
          const targetTop = initialTop + deltaY;

          const containerWidth = container.offsetWidth || 72;
          const containerHeight = container.offsetHeight || 90;

          const minX = 8;
          const maxX = window.innerWidth - containerWidth - 8;
          const minY = 64; // Below header
          const maxY = window.innerHeight - containerHeight - 8;

          const clampedX = Math.min(Math.max(minX, targetLeft), Math.max(minX, maxX));
          const clampedY = Math.min(Math.max(minY, targetTop), Math.max(minY, maxY));

          container.style.left = `${clampedX}px`;
          container.style.top = `${clampedY}px`;

          updateBubbleOrientation();
        }
      }

      function onPointerUp(e) {
        try {
          if (triggerBtn.hasPointerCapture(e.pointerId)) {
            triggerBtn.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);
          }
        } catch (_) {}

        triggerBtn.removeEventListener('pointermove', onPointerMove);
        triggerBtn.removeEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
        triggerBtn.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerUp);

        triggerBtn.style.cursor = 'grab';

        if (hasDragged) {
          justFinishedDrag = true;
          isDragging = false;
          setTimeout(() => {
            justFinishedDrag = false;
            hasDragged = false;
          }, 100);

          // Persist position
          const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
          try {
            localStorage.setItem(
              'nihongo_sensei_pos',
              JSON.stringify({
                leftRatio: rect.left / window.innerWidth,
                topRatio: rect.top / window.innerHeight,
              })
            );
          } catch (_) {}
        }
      }

      triggerBtn.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);

      // Click Sensei: Cycle quote if user tapped/clicked without dragging
      triggerBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        if (justFinishedDrag) {
          return;
        }
        cycleNextQuote();
      });

      // Close button
      closeBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.stopPropagation();
        closeBubble();
      });

      // Close on clicking outside container
      document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (!container.contains(e.target)) {
          closeBubble();
        }
      });

      // Close on Escape key
      document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if (e.key === 'Escape') {
          closeBubble();
        }
      });

      // Handle window resize: keep clamped
      window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
        if (container.style.left && container.style.top) {
          const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();
          const maxX = window.innerWidth - (container.offsetWidth || 72) - 8;
          const maxY = window.innerHeight - (container.offsetHeight || 90) - 8;
          const clampedX = Math.min(Math.max(8, rect.left), Math.max(8, maxX));
          const clampedY = Math.min(Math.max(64, rect.top), Math.max(64, maxY));
          container.style.left = `${clampedX}px`;
          container.style.top = `${clampedY}px`;
          updateBubbleOrientation();
        }
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initSensei);
    } else {
      initSensei();
    }
  })();
</script>
